  "storyPlan": {
    "premise": "Video idea: Introducing TikMaker – AI-powered educational video creation\n\nA short promotional video showcasing TikMaker, an AI-powered tool designed for creating educational, informational and technology-related short-form videos. Demonstrate how users can transform a simple idea into a structured script and visually engaging motion graphics video without manually designing and animating every scene. Highlight its ability to generate scene-by-scene content, animated typography, diagrams, icons and transitions in a vertical 9:16 format. Target tech creators, educators, AI enthusiasts and faceless content creators who want to publish engaging educational videos consistently."
  },
